     x = 6: clear at (r, j) = (3, 0)   -> opening k = 3
     x = 7: clear at (r, j) = (1, 0)   -> opening k = 1
     hkill holds for every integer x in 1..7: True

  OFF-lattice x needs no hypothesis (class_killer_int). Spot check, 1000 non-integers:
